 "structural_change": "R4 (r4m) = r3m + GPL_ROUTABILITY_DRIVEN=0: all four R3 kits (r3m/r3f/r3km/r3kf) were killed in 3_3 GPL (exit 247) after 3h46-5h22 stuck in routability iteration 1 (0.2% std-cell utilisation over 8.4-11.2 mm2, 1.02M instances incl. fixed; congestion is not a placement concern at this fill). Same RTL/pins/outline. Prev: R3 regional glue (STW-S81c-HEAD-GLUE 10-22) after s81hd_glue_m2/f2 FAIL (wire_reach: synthesis merged identical-D frame-header flops of different faces, core 856/999 um from pins; one-root spread 89.5/98.5). FROZEN interface (exact ot_s81hd_ctl_glue ports, ck, rst_n). Function by zone at its pins (WL lep / C core / N seq+spine / S spine / WH0 WH1 host / per-lane kept TX stages); every zone-to-zone signal on kept non-mergeable relay stages, hops <= 380 um, equal ages per bus group (relay_ledger.json); exact per-bit io_tcl at the H10 die link positions (draft 0/1 W as the die routes them), prove",
 "pin_regs": {
